# scenario-round-driven-formation-design - local dev secrets.
#
# NOTE: the workspace-level `.envrc` at `atelier-showcase/.envrc`
# already exports all provider keys via Keychain. direnv loads the
# nearest `.envrc` going up, so most devs do NOT need a scenario-level
# `.envrc` at all. Create one only if you want to override or restrict
# what this scenario sees, and use `source_up` to inherit the parent.
#
# The code is provider-agnostic. Manifold selects a healthy backend from
# the live credentials exposed by the operator environment. Keep provider
# key names and vendor-specific setup in Manifold or operator docs, not
# in atelier examples.

# source_up   # uncomment to inherit atelier-showcase/.envrc

# Optional: selection criteria.
# CONVERGE_LLM_PROFILE selects the needs spec Manifold ranks against.
# One of: interactive | analysis | batch | high_volume (default: interactive)
# export CONVERGE_LLM_PROFILE=analysis
